# Release builds handed to testers.
#
# These live in the repository root because that is where the build script drops
# them and where they are easiest to pick up from — but they are ~67 MB each and
# there are already nine, so one absent-minded `git add -A` would put half a
# gigabyte of binaries in the history, where it cannot be removed without
# rewriting it. The APK for any commit is reproducible from that commit.
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

# Patent filing and grant paperwork.
#
# Generated from the repository at a given revision (the technical disclosure
# embeds its own commit hash), so they are reproducible and do not belong in the
# history — and the merged volume alone is over a megabyte.
cubechat-patent-full.pdf
cubechat-technical-disclosure.pdf
cubechat-ui-source-appendix.pdf
cubechat-бізнес-план-грант.xlsx

# Promo cut, rebuilt from the generated footage by a script in the scratchpad.
cubechat-promo.mp4
cubechat-lantsyug.mp4
cubechat-film.mp4
cubechat-film-25s.mp4
